    "message": "[ipa-delivery:621] build(delivery): request private IPA 621 (MeloNX Core 621: Hogwarts GPU region copies, precise DMA reads, thread QoS, 1 GiB pipeline cache, gen0 budget; game box and French manuals) on top of delivered 620\n\nFrozen on 7d88bfe0: effective product digest cdfed832 (6855 product files) on the delivered 620\n(757e3b40, run 41527072487).\n- MeloNX: the Core of run 41552490728 (source 4ad8814e, packaged fingerprint 07e9d695) replaces\n  the 620 Core (c5627b99).\n- RPCS3: Core 619 unchangedFromBase.\n- Dolphin/ARMSX2, libretro and the MeloNX dependencies: republished from 620.\n- Commits: 9 reviewed (MeloNX and the game box/manuals of another session); 16 source-only RPCS3\n  Core 621 commits kept for 622.\n- Legal check passed. Images expected to change: App, MeloNXCore, melonx_internal_bridge, Runner.\n- Tests: fresh Flutter (16) and native (12) groups.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JA5QgKeoGVH5oVjNyhcj3D",
